# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# CODEOWNERS — Defines who must approve changes before merging
# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# When a PR modifies files matching a pattern, the listed owners
# are automatically requested for review and MUST approve.
#
# Format:  <pattern>  @github-username-or-team
# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

# ── CTP-wide config (affects ALL SOPs) — requires admin approval ──
/config/                        @hz3752

# ── Templates and build system — requires admin approval ──
/templates/                     @hz3752
/scripts/                       @hz3752
/schema/                        @hz3752

# ── Biomedical Imaging Lab SOPs — requires lab responsible person ──
/sops/biomedical_imaging/       @hz3752
/labs/biomedical_imaging/       @hz3752

# ── Example Lab (add real owners as needed) ──
# /sops/example_lab/            @lab-manager-username
# /labs/example_lab/            @lab-manager-username

# ── To add a new lab, copy the pattern above and set the owner:
# /sops/<lab_name>/             @responsible-person-github-username
# /labs/<lab_name>/             @responsible-person-github-username
